#. module: l10n_ca_pe_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_pe_payroll.source_wcb_coverage
msgid ""
"Coverage of the workers of most industries, with excluded occupations and "
"industries that may buy optional coverage; proprietors and partners of non-"
"incorporated businesses, independent operators and owners and directors of a"
" corporation are covered only by voluntary personal coverage."
msgstr ""

